1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,140
You snap your fingers.

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:02,960
And time stops.

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:04,440
Ten seconds.

4
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,940
The whole world freezes,

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,440
except you.

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,440
Pigeons hang in mid -air.

7
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,740
A coffee splash turns to glass.

8
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:14,900
A taxi stops mid -turn.

9
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,140
Sounds amazing,

10
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:16,540
right?

11
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,940
But there's a problem nobody talks

12
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:19,340
about.

13
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:20,720
To see anything,

14
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,660
light has to reach your eyes.

15
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,500
Normally,

16
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,280
light travels three million kilometres in

17
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,060
ten seconds.

18
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,980
That's almost eight trips to the

19
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:29,240
Moon.

20
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,200
But now,

21
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,060
light is frozen too.

22
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:33,720
Not a single bit of it

23
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:34,380
reaches you.

24
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:36,260
So the moment time stops,

25
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,240
you go completely blind.

26
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:39,520
And it gets worse.

27
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,160
You try to take a step.

28
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,440
But every air molecule around you

29
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,820
is frozen in place.

30
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:47,240
It's like being sealed inside solid

31
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:47,720
glass.

32
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:48,920
You can't walk.

33
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,700
You can't even breathe in.

34
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:51,640
No light.

35
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:52,740
No sound.

36
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,140
Just ten silent seconds.

37
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:56,040
Then,

38
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,320
time starts again.

39
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:58,680
The splash lands.

40
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,520
The pigeons fly off.

41
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:01,320
So,

42
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,000
would you still hit pause?

43
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,140
No sound.

